From 670a9dff81994d74a51bd3fb33304882341ad20c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:45:11 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: install an update from a file

An Install update from file row opens a picker for an update zip. It is copied to the downloader's
file and goes through the same checks (signature, device, A/B, source build); the build date and
incremental come from the zip, which must be newer than the installed build.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WNZzm3UdaCB3bu67ZPQkVe
